  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Dựng hình bình hành <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math> sao cho <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>45</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math> cùng hướng với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub></semantics></math>.<br>Khi đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>3</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>4</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mover><mi>F</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mn>34</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math>  là hình thoi.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>45</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>45</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>90</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>, nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math>  là hình vuông.<br>Khi đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mrow><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vì độ